xtual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","book_id":"b-shiji-036","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p028","text":"東樓公生西樓公，西樓公生題公，題公生謀娶公。謀娶公當周厲王時。謀娶公生武公。武公立四十七年卒，子靖公立。靖公二十三年卒，子共公立。共公八年卒，子德公立。德公十八年卒，弟桓公姑容立。桓公十七年卒，子孝公丐立。孝公十七年卒，弟文公益姑立。文公十四年卒，弟平公郁立。平公十八年卒，子悼公成立。悼公十二年卒，子隱公乞立。七月，隱公弟遂弒隱公自立，是為釐公。釐公十九年卒，子湣公維立。湣公十五年，楚惠王滅陳。十六年，湣公弟閼路弒湣公代立，是為哀公。哀公立十年卒，湣公子敕立，是為出公。出公十二年卒，子簡公春立。立一年，楚惠王之四十四年，滅杞。杞後陳亡三十四年。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"東樓公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"西樓公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"西樓公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"題公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"題公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"謀娶公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"謀娶公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"周厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"jps_m3k_hu4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"謀娶公","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","pers