"【索隱述贊】盛德之祀，必及百世。舜、禹餘烈，陳、杞是繼。媯滿受封，東樓纂系。閼路篡逆，夏姬淫嬖。二國衰微，或興或替。前並後虜，皆亡楚惠。句踐勃興，田和吞噬。蟬聯血食，豈其苗裔？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"6ip_dr3_fbl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"陳、杞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"媯滿","kind":"person","person_id":"6wx_fr3_b2e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"東樓","kind":"person","person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"閼路","kind":"person","person_id":"ohe_hlc_y40","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"夏姬","kind":"person","person_id":"3id_eoz_71f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"二國","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"楚惠","kind":"person","person_id":"bff_e4b_8yv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"i7a_22p_qda","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"田和","kind":"person","person_id":"m0b_b5e_153_**A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"苗裔","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","book_id":"b-shiji-036","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p054","text":"三十七年，楚惠王滅陳。熒惑守心。心，宋之分野也。景公憂之。司星子韋曰：「可移於相。」景公曰：「相，吾之股肱。」曰：「可移於民。」景公曰：「君者待民。」曰：「可移於歲。」景公曰：「歲饑民困，吾誰爲君！」子韋曰：「天髙聽卑。君有君人之言三，熒惑宜有動。」於是候之，果徙三度。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"楚惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"bff_e4b_8yv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"熒惑","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0029","start":29,"end":33,"surface":"司星子韋","kind":"person","person_id":"8l5_257_bj3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"君者","kind":"unresolved","perso